{"id":"H6054","lemma":"עֲנָנִי","transliteration":"anani","sayIt":"a-na-ni","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Anani","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.3.24;\nson of: Elioenai (H0454B);\nbrother of: Hodaviah (H1938), Eliashib (H0475), Pelaiah (H6411B), Akkub (H6126), Johanan (H3110I) and Delaiah (H1806)\n§ Anani = \"my cloud\"\nthe 7th son of Elioenai, descendant of David","glosses":["anani"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Anani","kjv":"and Anani"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 3:24","note":"The sons of Elioenai: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, and Anani, seven.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0454","lemma":"אֶלְיְהוֹעֵינַי","transliteration":"elyehoenay","gloss":"Eliehoenai"},{"id":"H0475","lemma":"אֶלְיָשִׁיב","transliteration":"elyashiv","gloss":"Eliashib"},{"id":"H1806","lemma":"דְּלָיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"delayah","gloss":"Delaiah"},{"id":"H1938","lemma":"הוֹדַוְיָה","transliteration":"hodavyah","gloss":"Hodaviah"},{"id":"H3110","lemma":"יוֹחָנָן","transliteration":"yochanan","gloss":"Johanan"},{"id":"H6411","lemma":"פְּלָאיָה","transliteration":"pelayah","gloss":"Pelaiah"},{"id":"H6126","lemma":"עַקּוּב","transliteration":"aqquv","gloss":"Akkub"},{"id":"H1939","lemma":"הוֹדַיְוָהוּ","transliteration":"hodayvahu","gloss":"Hodaiah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}